Subject: ns2 nameserver oddity

For a bit (I'm not sure how long?  Maybe following my
futile attempt to move my Tailscale provider to OIDC)
ns2 (nominally ns2.rapidcow.net) hasn't been serving
any DNS records, and my Tailscale ACL is to blame...

After a re-auth the ubuntu (ns1) server was untagged,
which my ACL would not allow.  (Normally untagged
machines are my laptops and phones, so just imagine
mistaking a VPS for that!)

Also, I'm gonna need to find a way to not display the
webmaster address directly, since (apparently) bots
have found this address and have been taking ample
pleasure in spamming my inbox with it...

(I won't be gone for long this time. :)
